><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Bildirim İçeriği</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Announcement Content</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-29000_Credit-Rating-row-9 abstract-row\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationSection|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-field-title\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title standardLabel\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Açıklamalar</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Explanations</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-29000_Credit-Rating-row-10 data-input-row alternate-row presentation-enabled\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationTextBlock|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><p><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">JCR Avrasya Derecelendirme A.Ş 2026 yılı derecelendirme çalışmaları sonucunda şirketimizin Uzun Vadeli Ulusal Kurum Kredi Rating Notu ''iyi kredi kalitesine sahip, yatırım yapılabilir\"' düzey olan BBB- (tr). Kısa Vadeli Ulusal Notu \"J3 (tr)\" ve notlara ilişkin &#160;görünümleri ise \"Durağan\" olarak revize edilmiştir.</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">JCR Avrasya Derecelendirme A.Ş'nin 27.10.2026 tarihli bildirim formu ekte yer almaktadır.</span><br/></p><p><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">Kamuoyunun bilgisine sunarız.</span><br/></p><p>Saygılarımızla ,</p><p><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">İşbu açıklamamızın İngilizce çevirisi ekte yer almakta olup, açıklama metinlerinde herhangi bir farklılık olması durumunda, Türkçe açıklama esas kabul edilecektir.</span><br/></p><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><p data-path-to-node=\"0\" class=\"first-token\"><span class=\"\">As a result of the rating process conducted by JCR Avrasya Derecelendirme A.</span>Ş. for the year 2026, our company's Long-Term National Corporate Credit Rating has been revised to <span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"175\">\"BBB- (tr)\"</span>, indicating an <span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"202\">\"investment grade with good credit quality\"</span> level. The Short-Term National Rating has been revised to <span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"304\">\"J3 (tr)\"</span>, and the outlooks for both ratings have been revised to <span data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"370\">\"Stable\"</span>.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"1\">The notification form dated October 27, 2026, received from JCR Avrasya Derecelendirme A.Ş., is attached hereto.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Respectfully submitted for the information of the public and our investors.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\"> </p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Turkish and English translations of this statement are available, and in case of any conflict between them, the Turkish version will prevail.<br/></p></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>"],"attachments":[{"objId":"4028328ca16c7de501a17d6ab452146d","fileName":"jcrer_Kayseri_Şeker_SPK-KAP_Bildirim_Formu_2026.pdf","fileExtension":"pdf"}]}]